Package: cagebreak
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Tiling Wayland compositor inspired by ratpoison
 Cagebreak is a tiling Wayland compositor inspired by the X11 window
 manager ratpoison. It provides a keyboard-centric window management
 experience where screen space is divided into non-overlapping tiles.
 .
 Features include:
  * Keyboard-driven window management
  * Tiling layout system
  * XWayland support
  * Configurable through a configuration file
  * IPC socket for external control
